  "prefLabel": "Env-C 206.03 Time for Filing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 206.03 Time for Filing. Any motion for reconsideration shall be filed no later than 30 days after the date the decision that is the subject of the motion was issued.\n\nSource. #6960, eff 3-25-99; ss by #8851-A, eff 3-25-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-c200.html"
